                    {
                        "form_id": "6ab7b3e4-7dbd-4384-84a4-8606824feaee",
                        "entry_id": "61a2d20e-ad02-3ccc-b72f-78910ba3abad",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "subsisted"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "009356ba-e290-37e4-abca-3d4aa3bbd6b4",
                        "entry_id": "61a2d20e-ad02-3ccc-b72f-78910ba3abad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To survive on a minimum of resources."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1611f9ce-99ea-4e07-89d7-2c52675ade0d",
                                "sense_id": "009356ba-e290-37e4-abca-3d4aa3bbd6b4",
                                "text": "It cannot be denied it is (if not the moſt of any) a very abſtemious animall, and ſuch as by reaſon of its frigidity, paucity of bloud, and latitancy in the winter (about which time the obſervations are often made) will long ſubſist without a viſible ſuſtentation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "935d793f-3e56-4b45-8241-b3c049fdee8f",
                                "sense_id": "009356ba-e290-37e4-abca-3d4aa3bbd6b4",
                                "text": "Let us, this day, imitate his Example in both theſe Reſpects ; and whilſt we are enjoying the good things of Life, let us remember Thoſe that want even the Neceſſaries and firſt Conveniences of it : And remember them, as We ourſelves ſhould have deſired to be remembred, had it been our ſad Lot, to ſubſiſt on other Mens Charity."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "262873a2-2e7c-33f6-949f-7a91f075a235",
                        "entry_id": "61a2d20e-ad02-3ccc-b72f-78910ba3abad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To have ontological reality; to exist."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f344f24d-91ca-4494-8f49-f6b6cd96ee1c",
                                "sense_id": "262873a2-2e7c-33f6-949f-7a91f075a235",
                                "text": "Remember Man! \"the Univerſal Cauſe / Acts not by partial, but by gen’ral Laws ; / And makes what Happineſs we juſtly call / Subſiſt not in the Good of one, but all."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f869c310-b385-4d80-8273-b31f9409f14a",
                                "sense_id": "262873a2-2e7c-33f6-949f-7a91f075a235",
                                "text": "Subject to section 5(1), copyright subsists only by virtue of this Act."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "693cad17-e89b-3f78-bdd9-7e2172494c79",
                        "entry_id": "61a2d20e-ad02-3ccc-b72f-78910ba3abad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To retain a certain state; to continue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66e2c8bc-9eed-4d44-b758-a90a9d71e9f6",
                                "sense_id": "693cad17-e89b-3f78-bdd9-7e2172494c79",
                                "text": "Firm we ſubſiſt, yet poſſible to ſwerve / Since Reaſon not impoſſibly may meet / Some ſpecious object by the Foe ſubornd, / And fall into deception unaware, / Not keeping ſtricteſt watch, as ſhe was warnd."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bac2422a-0888-456e-8500-9ef715ce284f",
                                "sense_id": "693cad17-e89b-3f78-bdd9-7e2172494c79",
                                "text": "It was impoſſible that the queen of France [Marie Antoinette] ſhould not be deeply affected by a conteſt, which ſo cloſely involved her neareſt and deareſt connections, and threatened ſo immediate and perhaps irreparable a breach of the harmony and friendſhip ſubſiſting between them."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6eb1086c-45ae-3e13-9482-530ee9c62708",
                        "entry_id": "61a2d20e-ad02-3ccc-b72f-78910ba3abad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To supply sustenance or subsistence to or for."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d9339d76-4350-43ea-88f5-c7ecdd019cf2",
                                "sense_id": "6eb1086c-45ae-3e13-9482-530ee9c62708",
                                "text": "With mutual toil, and intuitive dexterity, we built our commodious habitation in the hollow of a mango tree, that the fruit, which was then in bloſſom, might ſubſiſt our young."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d415002c-1665-4f50-a860-082c51219de5",
                        "source_entry_id": "61a2d20e-ad02-3ccc-b72f-78910ba3abad",
                        "source_sense_description": "to survive",
                        "target_lang_word": "subsister",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "subsister",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3ce7661-0b81-3d70-8fb2-4b8a5e5cf8f3",
                                        "entry_id": "d8a8aca7-c839-308b-82d1-5df9d6dec0f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exister encore, continuer d’être ; dans ce sens, ne peut se dire que des choses."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4f978e8-a478-4368-9d41-e7d94d275d20",
                                                "sense_id": "a3ce7661-0b81-3d70-8fb2-4b8a5e5cf8f3",
                                                "text": "La plupart des grands édifices des romains ne subsistent plus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9e5935e-7adb-40fa-8b5b-b65df462a41f",
                                                "sense_id": "a3ce7661-0b81-3d70-8fb2-4b8a5e5cf8f3",
                                                "text": "Le Panthéon subsiste en son entier à Rome."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35d1f964-312b-4b64-83bd-4d5d42470096",
                                                "sense_id": "a3ce7661-0b81-3d70-8fb2-4b8a5e5cf8f3",
                                                "text": "Les pyramides d’Égypte subsistent depuis bien des siècles."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b61ef5f-8e88-31e2-9bfb-a48ebe6efac6",
                                        "entry_id": "d8a8aca7-c839-308b-82d1-5df9d6dec0f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Demeurer en force et en vigueur ; se dit particulièrement des lois, des traités qu’on invoque, des propositions qu’on avance, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8a5d4b2-7207-44d2-887e-b83f65abaf05",
                                                "sense_id": "8b61ef5f-8e88-31e2-9bfb-a48ebe6efac6",
                                                "text": "Cette loi subsiste encore."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c058519f-aeff-4006-83dd-86204dc71e2e",
                                                "sense_id": "8b61ef5f-8e88-31e2-9bfb-a48ebe6efac6",
                                                "text": "On a révoqué cette ordonnance, elle ne subsiste plus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "025e453c-05ca-4cb3-a7d8-e59723f9f8d9",
                                                "sense_id": "8b61ef5f-8e88-31e2-9bfb-a48ebe6efac6",
                                                "text": "Tant que les traités subsisteront."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "383389ee-39c7-4484-9280-6a7ed7a44f4f",
                                                "sense_id": "8b61ef5f-8e88-31e2-9bfb-a48ebe6efac6",
                                                "text": "Malgré vos objections, ma remarque subsiste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e823bb6c-3965-438c-a247-d7df3a3c1630",
                                                "sense_id": "8b61ef5f-8e88-31e2-9bfb-a48ebe6efac6",
                                                "text": "L’amitié ne peut subsister sans l’estime."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df46392c-03fa-31d8-a343-6591d8296099",
                                        "entry_id": "d8a8aca7-c839-308b-82d1-5df9d6dec0f3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vivre et s’entretenir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "054bf002-2c12-4acb-aed7-50c242b0e18f",
                                                "sense_id": "df46392c-03fa-31d8-a343-6591d8296099",
                                                "text": "Quant à ceux qui, dans ce monde de richards, n'ont pour subsister que leurs salaires, il enragent, ils maugréent; ils se considèrent comme des déshérités."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
